{"version":1,"content":"<p>歐洲空間局（ESA）與日本宇宙航空研究開發機構（JAXA）宣佈，將於11月27日在倫敦科學博物館及線上同步舉行混合媒體簡報會，介紹貝皮科倫坡（BepiColombo）水星探測任務的最新進展及後續計劃。該簡報會定於格林尼治時間上午9時30分至11時舉行，即歐洲中部時間上午10時30分至12時。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1587648.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T12:23:51.505544+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":151,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T12:06:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T12:17:11.348703+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T12:17:11.348703+00:00","content_hash":"db1f3869a9eb65b17fc45c58951e04a0c899c8e3e3bb8fbe253a3532fbe8de4e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}